only tool press itself contributes after D1 — exactly as execution would (D2):
path-qualified names against the TARGET root, bare names on the deny-by-
default effective PATH. Reads config, writes nothing, executes nothing. Exit 0
all found, 1 any missing, 2 config/usage error.

